{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "8f56e39d049b0e9fee66619bc029258addf0a3c5fea17ce234b8575487757131", "ja": "本気すぎる思い", "zh": "过于认真的心意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "80868792411e3832a82567d5aff04d8556f89f0f5259c5cf1ba6747ebe9c3108", "ja": "未来は他の対決を見学したり、張り切って\nいる。しかしそのせいで打ち合わせに遅刻。\n未来の様子を心配する千鶴だが、真剣に\n対決を希望する姿に困惑。部屋をでようと\nしたその時、未来がふらついてしまう。", "zh": "未来参观了其他对决，还干劲十足。  \n然而也因此迟到了碰头会。担心未来状态的千鹤，对她认真希望参加对决的样子感到困惑。正要离开房间时，未来却踉跄了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fb6ab50d09aa4d66808d12dadb2ba6b532e8f4aa139a85a4f0f9aada90e38058", "ja": "（未来は千鶴さんと対決したいらしく、今日は\nその内容を決めるミーティングだ。だけど……）", "zh": "（未来好像想和千鹤小姐一决胜负，今天就是要决定对决内容的会议。不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "cff8b5ccc55b191be8926adca0df048305f1e96f65c495119eb4bdb2f3ec029c", "ja": "{$P$}、\n未来の姿が見当たりませんけれど……？", "zh": "{$P$}，似乎没看到未来的身影……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4819da213d50a0bc3eca66fa68a0ff21fd9da335417f7f8e1eb2ce24fd8ad363", "ja": "遅刻みたいです。昨日もその前も\nみんなの対決に顔を出してたので……。", "zh": "好像迟到了。昨天还有前天，她都去参加大家的对决了，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "64b7e32515793e38cca9a671ff722364cb208e00a6b63c9afe2bbe97ecff4de1", "ja": "そうでしたの。\n……あの、{$P$}。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。  \n……那个，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "257d2448e06f1b98efb5cf6920add17bad4776ca13fa5252d578861e95522f6e", "ja": "最近の未来は張り切りすぎではなくて？\n公演のレッスンも控えているというのに……。", "zh": "最近的未来是不是太拼了？\n明明还有演出的排练要准备……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0c54af2d9a66f85faa7eb672d71f58f07fc97ae67c8c480995d4856302bf9e83", "ja": "そうですね。\nちょっと前のめりだなと感じています。", "zh": "是啊。\n我也觉得她有点太过急于求成了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "14108e04fb8ffc5adb99dea96d576ddcae7a3021487c9c3271fe7c62a785b8ae", "ja": "差し出がましいかもしれませんが、調子を崩す前に\nストップをかけた方がよろしいのではないかと。", "zh": "虽然可能有些多管闲事，但在搞坏身体之前，\n是不是叫停一下会比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "dafed46320ab7ff8d3e8be8eaa6bfc6d7b4db8413a9a0a74de7ec8f53414206d", "ja": "未来の好きにさせてみてはと言っておいて、\n意見を変えるのは心苦しいのですが……。", "zh": "明明说过不妨让未来按自己的想法去做，现在却要改变意见，实在让我过意不去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b25ca0ea0c58be06cabb382c2d60b9ef0767cf04fefefecd09cea9a40f55cc00", "ja": "いえ。俺も、今日の遅刻で\nちょっと看過できないなと感じていましたから。", "zh": "不。因为今天迟到的事，\n我也觉得有点不能坐视不管了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4482852d5367131a875b13463106fa541c1fec6a11719fa3a945aa92d120af1e", "ja": "この後のミーティングの様子次第で、\nストップするか判断しようと思います。", "zh": "我打算根据接下来会议的情况，判断要不要叫停。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "008c2e3ec1daada102b326b4d9c5f6a8190620e22d69f8a6bee265b6a745c5da", "ja": "ええ。\nそうしてくださいまし。", "zh": "好的。\n就请这样做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1011_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "ad739230117cdbefb6bfd3c3b6c224769e572df1961208b566292b15df274fe2", "ja": "ごめんなさ～い！\nみんなの対決見てたら遅れちゃって……。", "zh": "对不起呀～！\n看大家对决看得入迷，不小心就迟到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "e5f060f5617927228aaa542573d9b95ff47ca96dc38373ca7fac6c04df55e9d8", "ja": "未来、まずはこれで力をつけなさいな。\n我が家のシェフお手製のコロッケですわ。", "zh": "未来，先吃这个补充体力吧。\n这是我家厨师亲手做的可乐饼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "cf86e9c270510c3a04e7137410851081e0f0e5fb3b9dcb43ecb9a7334f0c820a", "ja": "わ～！　私、千鶴さんの差し入れコロッケ\n大好きです！　いただきます！", "zh": "哇～！我最喜欢千鹤小姐带来的炸肉饼了！我开动啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "613ec2b6b1670fcb25939a73ac4abea86faee2fe3a64a344f53978e3e4d2bf6c", "ja": "あ、千鶴さんとは、\nコロッケを作る対決するのもいいかも！", "zh": "啊，说不定和千鹤小姐来一场制作可乐饼的对决也不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "2ec4062ffb44a56ec1b1b404ee3655b13cd1e0831a6742c351bbf4aa35b102ad", "ja": "こ、コロッケを作る対決？\nなぜ、わたくしとの対決でコロッケを……？", "zh": "可、可乐饼制作对决？\n为什么要和我进行可乐饼对决……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "c8d89f2b7a3b83243062de597aec6d104574a926ba09a53fc84553c290724fd5", "ja": "いつも差し入れしてくれますし！\nそういえば私、料理の対決ってやってなかったので。", "zh": "因为您平时经常会带好吃的来犒劳我们呀！\n而且这么说来，我好像还没比过做饭呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6a00d2b0f3762878ff5aab0fdd5cb83483cc83313cdc72c796fd68e5f377e556", "ja": "つまり……単なる思いつきってことか。", "zh": "也就是说……只是临时起意吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "6ebada7d38ca8959eec03672f314440352ac78b33aea0cd082d9261c76fd7b1d", "ja": "はいっ！\nすごくないですか？　でへへ♪", "zh": "是！\n很厉害吧？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ad8b70a19f34e3c52e2cbe86c4ecf9d494840020a74a74462f05951b213354ec", "ja": "いや、褒めたわけではないんだけどな。", "zh": "不，我倒不是在夸你就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "8856b372bb3ae8efc0bca6cb27a94f226dcdca3f1aeb0d9d5c50217f9c1a25d9", "ja": "コロッケ対決……わたくしは構いませんが、\n経験値が違いすぎるような気が……。", "zh": "可乐饼对决……本小姐倒是没意见，不过总觉得经验值差得太多了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "8d0f8207592f3ffe9af737e7ba31ce52712fe9b16d5c9796546eeab3c9726c05", "ja": "経験値？", "zh": "经验值？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "1f24fda7bee4a74baf26d0290ebb0189941145a7ae77cde78d46163f634733b3", "ja": "いえっ！　その……わたくしはうちのシェフの\nコロッケを、何度も口にしていますので！？", "zh": "不、不是的！那个……因为我多次吃过\n我家主厨做过的可乐饼！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "e93f6400a99a24c3bf7fafc8e16a0da59cd7b652f5d0f087d3a25f81f4c97034", "ja": "その再現ともなれば、さすがにわたくしに\n有利に働いてしまうのではないかと……。", "zh": "要是复刻那个味道的话，未免就会对我太有利了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "106c7e0a9041581720838e85fcea44e94bfe0f85d0323fd858e54de2ee46244b", "ja": "あ、そっかー。\nそれもそうですよね～。", "zh": "啊，这样啊——\n确实也是呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "812a3b78bb1f6f8911aeec21fe0b89c1973e5903958f266530745dec3653349c", "ja": "それじゃあセレブ対決とか、\nお嬢様の言葉遣いの対決とか……？", "zh": "那要不要来场名媛对决，或者比比大小姐的说话方式之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f0f314a622f411683cf240b0d640724906c31253692b3495f5a5e85270d79f45", "ja": "千鶴さんらしさはあるけど、\n大体、未来に不利な気がするな。", "zh": "虽然有千鹤的风格，不过总觉得大体上对未来不利啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "617e3db3e36a0b23bb3f42683710741ef63d42ee5a4bf92ba37eea35524080b7", "ja": "んー難しいなぁ……あ！　テレビでよくやってる\n『ズバリとセレブ！』対決はどうですか！？", "zh": "嗯～好难啊……啊！电视上经常播的\n“一锤定名流！”对决怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1029_038chz", "source_sha256": "b8b50b109172d3161786c161d6e663e3405bf472e3d64088663c0808e0fb6f50", "ja": "『ズバリとセレブ！』……もしかしなくても、\nあの大人気番組の、ですわよね？", "zh": "『ズバリとセレブ！』……不用猜也知道，您说的是那档超受欢迎的节目吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1030_038chz", "source_sha256": "1e00c098554135628950a6f3710f06224dc0598461391143bba0aa8c488aaa07", "ja": "同じ品物のお求めやすい方と高級な方を比べて、\n高級な方を当てるという……。", "zh": "将同一种物品中平价的一方和高档的一方进行对比，\n猜出哪一个是高档货……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "e9b10a249d0bfe3d8e0ad34cfef7be5ccf689bdf92b1e03121b9b20ac53766ad", "ja": "はい！　セレブの人には簡単かもですけど、\n二択なら私にもチャンスがあるかも！", "zh": "是的！对名流来说可能很简单，但如果是二选一的话，说不定我也有机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "b0827b46e533f390a7a79c3ac3f230790c6b434172769a0f0c2c83368ea35c56", "ja": "まあ、そういう意味なら\n勝機は確かにあるかもだけど……。", "zh": "好吧，从这种层面上说，\n确实可能是有胜算的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "33a16c3e131c0ebd0c9fb541d720f97d0ec030b9328bbdd05da33f119ada7c97", "ja": "もちろんあてずっぽうじゃなくて、ちゃんと\n判断します！　私、千鶴さんと対決したいですから！", "zh": "当然不是靠猜，我会认真判断的！因为我想和千鹤小姐一决胜负！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "b388d17dc8139a81d4c4602a2a8dccc1606cf104f10ac807da84e8576aa405c0", "ja": "未来……。", "zh": "未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "63ffe71865a12789217ede9efb1d21b6ac011834c63c7e360d9980957d560744", "ja": "おっと、会議室を押さえてた時間がそろそろ終わるな。\n延長してもいいけど……。", "zh": "哎呀，预订会议室的时间差不多要到了。\n虽然延长也可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "62232a74f6bb49b4d53aecc59cecef4dd84b95efd043db6cc6b788e0d652c182", "ja": "ええっ、もうそんな時間ですか！？\nじゃあ急いで、会議室から移動しなくちゃ……わ。", "zh": "诶，已经到这个时间了吗！？\n那得赶紧从会议室转移出去……呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "00451ff4df152e7e5c51f970fd720c29354894b68f93b5e7e2479a9ce7997f0d", "ja": "おっとっと……あれ？", "zh": "哎呀呀……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "03550ebad4096588088f21d693303842bfe8fee969798e3b617a3fb4f7c96334", "ja": "そんなにふらついて……。\nうん、未来はちょっと根を詰めすぎだな。", "zh": "你怎么晃得这么厉害……  \n嗯，未来，你有点太拼命了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "a91f8f6eb09b32f3d711e01dd9b556ac0137bbcba4c4e4138c471e9f23ecfc8e", "ja": "今日はここまでにしておこう。\n念のため、病院で軽く診てもらおうか。", "zh": "今天就先到这里吧。\n以防万一，去医院简单检查一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "7e03ff352088d5c3b86cd1d6353e2eb25a4d727fe4e9f10345c9e75cb5fbe03e", "ja": "い、いえ！\n私、すっごく元気です！　まだやれます！", "zh": "不、不用了！\n我精神得很！还能继续！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1041_038chz", "source_sha256": "94a87986deb817c9ec4f3b629d738af36430c3e31b488b793370e7a43c79642e", "ja": "未来。わたくしも\n{$P$}と同意見ですわ。", "zh": "未来。我也和{$P$}的意见一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1042_038chz", "source_sha256": "d7259addc656f64348b948210642f1929fdc5ac7f7e99ae11431e56206e936ad", "ja": "病院にはわたくしも付き合いますわ。\nどうしても話しがしたいなら、その後に。ね？", "zh": "我也陪你一起去医院。\n如果无论如何都想谈谈，那就等之后再说。好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "314ff3cc635e3355ff1a5016b08a453c259a773972cd4b1a094ce0746fc34372", "ja": "うう～……\nわかりました……。", "zh": "呜呜～……\n知道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "ab0672f3a3c188ff9c4b9f76dcf5602e628f6bd254f039ed01172c1ae2564168", "ja": "（やはり未来は張り切りすぎていたみたいだ。\n熱心なのは結構なことではあるんだけど……）", "zh": "（看来未来果然是太过拼命了。热心是好事没错，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "78ecb3d5ce84a35beba06dd511091f2619ad1c9dba492f5690fb68eba23717da", "ja": "（いや、今は考え事をしている場合じゃないな。\n未来を病院に連れて行かないと）", "zh": "（不，现在可不是思考这些的时候。得带未来去医院才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
